# Things between the two of you (she was there). {deed} is the fact from her mouth ("you helped me out"), {when},
# {thing} a short noun ("the teddy bear", "the walk home"), {note} the free text of a memory, {speed} same_day/fast/normal.

# ---------------- you bring it up ----------------
@rule me.us.plain
on me.us
- [Hey, about {thing}...|So, {thing}...|I was thinking about {thing}.]
- Remember {thing} {when}?

@rule me.us.gift
on me.us
when realverb=gave_gift
- [So... did you like {thing}?|Was {thing} okay?|I hope {thing} wasn't weird.]
- [Did you end up keeping|What did you think of] {thing}?

@rule me.us.help
on me.us
when realverb=helped|stood_up_for
- [About {when}... are you okay now?|Everything alright after {when}?]
- I hope I wasn't [butting in|out of line] {when}.

@rule me.us.lunch
on me.us
when realverb=ate_with
- Lunch {when} was nice. [We should do that again.|I liked it.]

@rule me.us.walk
on me.us
when realverb=walked_home
- [Did you get home okay|Thanks for letting me walk you home] {when}.

@rule me.us.date
on me.us
when realverb=dated
- [I had fun on our date.|About our date {when}...] [Did you?|Was it okay?]

@rule me.us.romance
on me.us
when realverb=kissed|confessed|started_dating
- [About {thing}...|Can we talk about {when}?] [I've been thinking about it a lot.|I can't stop thinking about it.]

@rule me.us.h
on me.us
when realverb=had_h
- [About {when}...|So, {when}...] [Are you okay with... everything?|I keep thinking about it.]

@rule me.us.h.fast
on me.us
when realverb=had_h speed=same_day|fast
- [Things went really fast {when}, huh.|We kind of rushed things {when}, didn't we?]
- [I didn't expect|Neither of us expected] things to go that far that fast.

@rule me.us.dating.fast
on me.us
when realverb=started_dating speed=same_day|fast
- We started going out [really fast|pretty much right away], huh?

# ---------------- her side ----------------
@rule us.plain
on us
opens share,tease,ask
- [Oh, {thing}?|{Thing}...] [Yeah, I remember.|I was just thinking about it.|That was nice.]
- [Ha, you remember that?|You still think about {thing}?] [Me too, a little.|That's kind of sweet.]

@rule us.gift.liked
on us
when realverb=gave_gift opinion>=1
opens share,tease,invite
feel smile
- [I love it!|It's really cute.|I keep it on my desk.] [Thank you, really.|Nobody's given me something like that in a long time.|I look at it every night.]
- [{Thing}? Of course I liked it!|I'm using it right now, actually.] [You've got good taste.|How did you know?]

@rule us.gift.meh
on us
when realverb=gave_gift opinion<=0
opens ask,share,thank
- [Ah, {thing}...|Yeah, {thing}.] [It was... nice of you.|It's the thought that counts, right?|I put it somewhere safe.]

@rule us.helped
on us
when realverb=helped
opens share,tease,praise
feel smile
- [I never really thanked you for {when}.|You really saved me {when}.] [I owe you one.|So... thanks.|I won't forget it.]
- [Ah, that?|You helping me out?] [It meant more than you think.|I was kind of lost before you showed up.]

@rule us.defended
on us
when realverb=stood_up_for
opens share,praise,tease
feel shy
- [You didn't have to stand up for me like that.|Nobody's ever done that for me.] [But... I'm glad you did.|I was really happy.|My heart was pounding.]

@rule us.promise
on us
when realverb=kept_promise
opens praise,share,thank
feel smile
- [You kept your word.|You actually did it.] [Most people don't.|I'll remember that.|I knew I could count on you.]

@rule us.lunch
on us
when realverb=ate_with
opens invite,tease,share
feel smile
- [Lunch was nice.|That was fun, eating together.] [We should make it a habit.|Next time I'm making the bento.|You eat really fast, by the way.]

@rule us.walk
on us
when realverb=walked_home
opens invite,tease,share
feel shy
- [The walk home?|Yeah, I got home fine.] [It went by too fast.|We should take the long way next time.|My mom saw us from the window, you know.]

@rule us.date
on us
when realverb=dated
opens invite,share,tease
feel smile
- [I had a really good time.|Our date? It was great.] [Let's go again soon.|I keep replaying it in my head.|Next time I'll pick the place.]

@rule us.kiss
on us
when realverb=kissed
opens tease,share,invite
feel shy
- [D-don't just bring that up out of nowhere!|The kiss...] [My face is getting hot.|I still can't believe it happened.|...I don't regret it.]

@rule us.confessed
on us
when realverb=confessed
opens share,tease,ask
feel shy
- [The confession...|Ah, that day.] [My heart was going crazy.|I thought I was going to faint.|I'm glad I said it. Or that you did.]

@rule us.dating
on us
when realverb=started_dating
opens share,tease,invite
feel smile
- [We're really going out, huh?|It still feels like a dream.] [I like how that sounds.|My friends keep teasing me about it.|Don't make me say it out loud again.]

@rule us.dating.fast
on us
when realverb=started_dating speed=same_day|fast
opens share,tease,ask
feel shy
- [It was fast, wasn't it?|We barely knew each other.] [But it felt right.|My friends think I'm crazy.|Do you think we rushed it?]

@rule us.flirt
on us
when realverb=flirted|held_hands
opens tease,share,invite
feel shy
- [Ah... that?|You're bringing that up now?] [You were pretty bold.|I didn't mind. At all.|I wasn't expecting it.]

@rule us.shared
on us
when realverb=shared
opens share,tease,ask
feel smile
- [That time? {Note}|Oh, I remember. {Note}] [I think about it sometimes.|It was a good day.]

# ---------------- H, by how fast it went and who she is ----------------
@rule us.h
on us
when realverb=had_h
opens share,tease,invite
feel shy
- [W-what about it?|...Yeah.|Mm.] [It was... good.|I'm still a little embarrassed.|Don't look at me like that.]

@rule us.h.fast.reserved
on us
when realverb=had_h speed=same_day|fast profile=reserved
opens comfort,share,ask
feel worried
- [I... I don't usually do things like that.|I still can't believe I did that.|We'd only just met...] [What must you think of me?|I keep thinking about it.|I don't regret it, but... it was so fast.]
- [It went so fast.|I'm not that kind of girl, you know.] [I want you to know that.|I just... with you, I didn't want to stop.]

@rule us.h.fast.normal
on us
when realverb=had_h speed=same_day|fast profile=normal
opens share,tease,comfort
feel shy
- [Yeah... things went fast.|We kind of skipped a few steps, huh?] [I'm not complaining.|I guess we really clicked.|Let's not rush everything else, okay?]

@rule us.h.fast.open
on us
when realverb=had_h speed=same_day|fast profile=open
opens tease,invite,share
feel smile
- [Fast? Was it?|Ha, you're still thinking about that?] [I just knew what I wanted.|Why wait?|You weren't complaining at the time.]

@rule us.h.normal.close
on us
when realverb=had_h speed=normal rel=girlfriend|lover
opens tease,invite,share
feel love
- [It felt natural with you.|I'm glad it was you.] [We were ready.|I feel closer to you now.]

@rule us.h.public
on us
when realverb=had_h public=yes
opens hush,tease,ask
feel worried
- [In the {fplace}, though...|We were in the {fplace}!] [What if someone saw us?|I can't walk past that spot anymore without blushing.|Please tell me nobody saw.]
